				<h1 id="versionHeadLine" class="headline">

Board of Commissioners		</h1>
	
		<div id="cc05fa16d7-bbcd-4ec8-a779-15ef67955aa8" data-containerid="05fa16d7-bbcd-4ec8-a779-15ef67955aa8" class="pageContent cpGrid cpGrid24"  >
			

		<div class="row outer wide"><!--
--><div class="outer col col24 first last" style="" data-widgetcontainerid="2e463396-f784-4339-8c2d-6039dfce924e">				
	<div class="row nest first last wide">
	
	<div class="inner col col24 first last id8897c36f-dc2b-40cb-8088-43456e7bdd0f" style="" data-widgetcontainerid="8897c36f-dc2b-40cb-8088-43456e7bdd0f">	
<div class="widget editor pageStyles narrow" id="divEditor5df5468b-8207-412c-9e4c-b8d3042460e3" data-elementqueryclasses='{"wide-narrow":"min-width:25em"}'>
	    <div class="fr-view">


        <h2 class="subhead1">Meetings</h2><ul><li>6:30 pm</li><li>Second Thursday of each month</li><li>Goodlettsville City Hall, Massie Chambers</li><li><a aria-describedby="audioeye_new_window_message" aria-label="Guidelines for Citizens Comments Opens in new window" href="/DocumentCenter/View/1440" rel="noopener" target="_blank">Guidelines for Citizens Comments</a></li></ul><h2 class="subhead1">Members</h2><p>Five City Commissioners are elected by citizens to serve four-year, alternating terms. Elections are conducted every two years.</p><p>Current Commissioners are:</p><table style="width: 100%; margin: auto; border-width: 1px; border-style: solid;"><colgroup><col style="width: 50.0000%;"><col style="width: 50.0000%;"></colgroup><tbody><tr><td><a href="https://www.goodlettsville.gov/directory.aspx?EID=118">Rusty Tinnin, Mayor</a></td><td>Term Expires 11/2026</td></tr><tr><td><a href="https://www.goodlettsville.gov/directory.aspx?EID=100">Jennifer Duncan, Vice Mayor</a></td><td>Term Expires 11/2028</td></tr><tr><td><a href="https://www.goodlettsville.gov/directory.aspx?EID=152">Jimmy D. Anderson, Commissioner</a></td><td>Term Expires 11/2026</td></tr><tr><td><a href="https://www.goodlettsville.gov/directory.aspx?EID=101">Cisco Gilmore, Commissioner</a></td><td>Term Expires 11/2028</td></tr><tr><td><a href="https://www.goodlettsville.gov/directory.aspx?EID=102">Jesse Walker, Commissioner</a></td><td>Term Expires 11/2028</td></tr></tbody></table><p><br></p><h2 class="subhead1 ">Agendas &amp; Minutes</h2><p>View agendas, meeting packets, live meetings, public notices, and archives.</p><p><a aria-describedby="audioeye_new_window_message" href="http://www.goodlettsville.gov/1820/Agendas-Minutes" rel="noopener" target="_blank">Agendas and Minutes</a></p>
    </div>

<script type="text/javascript">
